{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X 的感受短词和意象较密，部分时刻容易让注意力分散，扫读的利落度不如 Y 的左右分栏。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 的关键心理转折有【】突出，尤其把舍不得从前的亲近、害怕孤单、担心回去又受委屈这几层动机区分得更清楚，不只是告诉观众他难过。它的感受词还跟着音乐进程逐步出现，能让人感到情绪如何从怀念、焦躁、反复动摇走向带着想念继续生活，细腻程度和前后呼应都更好。Y 的叙述更顺、更容易扫读，但部分音乐情绪和心理变化被概括掉了。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9c232691-be76-4453-8ce9-1d055b04251b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T205834549773Z", "elapsed_seconds": 89.344, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:00:03.908178+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d1b1bee95bf3438c4b9df630988d80cfe6df50da94a23a77d01d1ff1b5ebe20d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa238